---
const previewSrc = "/img/preview.webp";
const bgPlaceholder = "data:image/webp;base64,YOUR_BLUR_PLACEHOLDER";
---

<section
  class="relative w-full py-32 pt-32  px-6 flex flex-col items-center text-left overflow-hidden text-white bg-black"
  aria-labelledby="video-preview-heading"
>
  <!-- Background Image -->
  <picture class="absolute inset-0 z-10">
    <source
      srcset="/img/temp2.svg"
      sizes="100vw"
      type="image/svg"
    />
    <img
      src="/img/temp2.svg"
      alt=""
      class="w-full h-full object-cover"
      loading="lazy"
      decoding="async"
    />
  </picture>

  <!-- Video/Image Preview -->
  <div class="max-w-6xl w-full relative z-10">
    <div class="relative rounded-2xl shadow-lg overflow-hidden">
      <img
        src={previewSrc}
        alt="Sandworm platform interface showing blockchain data analytics dashboard"
        width="1144"
        height="665"
        class="w-full h-auto min-h-125 object-cover"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Text Content Overlay -->
  <div class="lg:absolute bottom-0 grid grid-cols-[65%_35%]
 lg:px-16 px-2 lg:pt-20 pt-16 z-10 bg-linear-to-b from-transparent to-black/90 backdrop-blur-[0.2rem]   mx-auto w-[80%] pb-24">
    <div class="overflow-hidden">
      <p class="uppercase font-semibold mb-4 text-xs font-primary">
        <span aria-hidden="true">●</span> Easy intelligence
      </p>

      <h2 id="video-preview-heading" class="lg:text-[2.5rem] text-3xl leading-[1.4] font-body font-medium">
        Unlock Clear,<br />
        Actionable Data for<br />
        Smarter Decisions.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="text-base text-custom-light-gray leading-normal max-w-120">
      <p class="mb-5 font-body">
        Most analytics tools are built for engineers, complicated, rigid,
        and slow. Sandworm brings simplicity and speed to everyone.
      </p>
      <p class="font-body">
        Whether you're a protocol team, data analyst, or founder, Sandworm
        adapts to how you work — not the other way around.
      </p>
      <a
        href="/waitlist"
        class="rounded-2xl p-2.5 h-fit m-0.5 bg-white text-black hover:bg-white/90 hover:scale-105 transition-all px-5 font-medium font-primary inline-block text-sm mt-5"
      >
        Get Started
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>